    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLOR BOMB!: Just a simple color-matching game.</h2><br>How to Play:<br>Your mission in &quot;COLOR BOMB!&quot; is straightforward:<br><br><strong>1. Observe and Remember:</strong> At the start of each wave, a variety of colors are displayed. Your first task? Memorize those colors!<br><strong>2. Find the Missing Color:</strong> Pay attention to the color that doesn't appear in the current wave. Was green missing this time?<br><strong>3. Time to Explode:</strong> Select the color that was absent in the previous wave and score points by blowing it up. If green was missing, bomb it! Utilize your memory.<br><strong>4. Perfect Timing:</strong> Choosing the right color is essential, but timing is also crucial. Earn extra points by bombing the missing color at the exact right moment!<br><br>Features:<br><strong>Dynamic Waves:</strong> Each wave introduces a new set of colors, keeping the game fresh and challenging.<br><strong>Intuitive Gameplay:</strong> Simple yet addictive gameplay, easy to learn but hard to master.<br><strong>Score Multipliers:</strong> Rewards for perfect timing. The better the timing, the higher the score.<br><br>Can you keep up with the ever-changing waves and bomb the correct color at the right time?",
